Package: metforminTTE
Title: Propensity-Matched Target Trial Emulation of Metformin Use
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Kelin", "Zhong", email = "kelinzhonguconn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Chia-Ling", "Kuo", email = "kuo@uchc.edu", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Propensity-score-matched target trial emulation for matched-pair
    pharmacoepidemiology studies. Provides staged construction of matched
    cohorts, intention-to-treat and per-protocol analysis strategies,
    competing-risk outcome models with cluster-robust standard errors,
    false-discovery-rate adjustment, and forest plot output.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    data.table (>= 1.12.8),
    survival (>= 3.0),
    digest (>= 0.6.0),
    crrSC (>= 1.1.2),
    forestploter (>= 1.1.3),
    stats,
    utils,
    tools,
    grDevices,
    graphics
URL: https://github.com/KelinZhong/MetforminTTE
BugReports: https://github.com/KelinZhong/MetforminTTE/issues
